--- !u!102 &432876024
TextMesh:
  serializedVersion: 3
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 432876022}
  m_Text: 'Dinnah loves lasagna!

    Make Dinah eat as much lasagna as

    possible,
    so she can grow and reach

    her potential height.

    The sky is the limit!


    Don''t
    let her head hit her

    body or the walls.


    To control the snake, press

    on
    your keyboard:

    Left Arrow

    Up arrow

    Down arrow

    Right arrow'
